    <div class="story__content">
      <h2 class="story__title">Implementation of Changes</h2>
      <p class="story__text">
        After troubleshooting and listing potential causes, I implemented changes to the measurement setup and acquisition process on system level.
      </p>
      <p class="story__text">
        The deviations were majorly minimized after the changes, and the work provided a clearer path for future sound measurement troubleshooting.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

